{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_asbest_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_asbest_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"奇景","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_asbest_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"15b2e5c23af84f9424cedc58313cb4068f7b38610bed8cbcb4464fefcda66ecd","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"景是奇景，人也是奇景。石棉看奇景，奇景看石棉。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這裡啦，嘉維爾和我說過了，你也是羅德島上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我的手下們都是做生意的，我給他們多多少少都教了點薩爾貢語，你要是有什麼想要的，跟他們買就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。但那人怎麼一直盯著我看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這裡很少有人來，他們看到外鄉人還是挺開心的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"起碼我挺開心的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧她的尾巴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"她的尾巴看起來好柔軟......肉肉的但又很細長......尾巴尖好靈活......上面還有橘色的花紋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"看到了嗎？她用尾巴提起了那麼大一包東西？！還有那個門板，看起來也好重，她一隻手就拿起來了？哇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"她摔跤一定很厲害，她看起來一尾巴就能掃斷一棵樹，她、她......好美啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來沒見過這樣的人，我要和她做朋友！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等一下，就這樣上去嗎，我、我還有點，不好意思——啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"磐蟹護甲，磐蟹護腿！堅硬的外殼可以抵擋一切攻擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"鋸齒鱗牙錘，鋸齒鱗骨刀！鋒利的齒刃可以破開一切物品！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"（過來了過來了......！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"呃呃——你好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！我、我喜歡你的尾巴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的尾巴？你在說啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......姑奶奶忙得很，別擋路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗚！好可怕......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"啊、等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"你好凶啊，我說我喜歡你欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該對我也表示一下才行呀，你不覺得我的尾巴也很好看嗎？很多人都誇我長了一條很帥氣的尾巴呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？你在說什麼啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自己找點事去做，拉著你的朋友玩泥巴吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"你會說我們這裡的話欸？但怎麼都是髒話啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"我不玩泥巴！你小看我是不是，我已經不是孩子了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們打一架！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，你這人怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把路讓開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你想死啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很美行了吧？你尾巴好看！特別美！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？沒完沒了的！來勁了是吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"呵——打起來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"別碰壞我的東西——哇哦！用尾巴纏她脖子，打得好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我的油灑了——借油潤滑防止摔跤嗎，好厲害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"打得好！打得好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"快藏好，這個灌木能遮住我們幾個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"你倆昨天還沒打夠嗎，今天還要拉著我來看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"你倆又是為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"她買了不少東西，我當然要看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"她打我真的好狠，我尾巴上鱗片都掉了好幾個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"不過她買了一堆東西，但又不住村子裡，在這裡搭棚子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"但她倒是挺會選位置的，這棵樹離河灘也不算太遠，漲水了也淹不到，取水也方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"她、她抓了條好大的毛毛蟲！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"她把它炒了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"她放到餅上了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"她吃了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"這人不簡單啊，你看她在找石頭煮湯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是只有我們村的人才知道的！這種有鹹味的石頭，放進湯裡可以增加鮮味，她從哪裡學來的？昨天集市上沒看見有人跟她說啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，她還知道那個藤！還是你跟我說的呢，嚼起來是酸甜味道的，我可喜歡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，她要去抓鱗了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"她最多能抓到幾條細紋鱗，鋸齒鱗可不好抓，我用尾巴才能釣上來幾條，還會被咬破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"外鄉人最多知道點石頭藤條什麼的，抓鱗我可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"她怎麼做到的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"她、我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我們去折點藤條吃~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩個小時後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"那個、那個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我說你們幾個以為我沒看見嗎，還要跟著我到什麼時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你旁邊那個呢，她掉水裡被鱗吃了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的，她、她剛才看到你吃毛毛蟲，她也想吃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"她好像吃錯蟲了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"我、你能來幫我們一下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這都什麼人啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你吃了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道她吃的是什麼蟲？吃了多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道......但只吃了一點點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那她吐了嗎？現在是醒著還是昏迷了？身上有沒有出紅腫斑點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了！我自己看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒發熱，身上也沒出斑，這個是能催吐的草藥，拿去煮水給她喝，先把吃進去的東西都吐出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓她多喝水。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"她吐了三次，說自己再吐不出什麼東西來了，然後就睡過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"應該沒什麼事了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，再多喝水！然後，你們安靜點，別一直在我旁邊嗡嗡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"篝火好暖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"我想唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我也想！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"肌肉塊大真是好~♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"妹妹種地哥哥打獵~下的小崽白又壯~♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們真的是姑奶奶我遇到的最離譜的一群人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前就想問了，“姑奶奶”是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"她可能是這裡誰的親戚吧，你看我們都長尾巴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"姑奶奶，你從哪裡來的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"姑奶奶，你、你為什麼吃毛毛蟲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"你來我們這裡幹什麼呀，你還買了我的東西，你要住在這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......我真的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不住，我爬大瀑布。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"咦——說大話~從來沒人能爬上去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，哦，嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"那你為什麼要爬瀑布？會死吧？而且爬上去幹什麼，上面會有更多的鱗嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看風景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"看風景......？瀑布嗎？不是這裡到處都有的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刺激。爬瀑布很爽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，刺激......？我們住在這裡，找到吃的，活下去就好了，爬瀑布刺激嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，這裡就是我們生活的地方，而且萬一上面有一堆毒蟲，你不就死了？這可不刺激啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，會死的，你不要想不開啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是前幾天買東西把身上的錢都花光了，我們都看到你吃毛毛蟲了，但你會抓鱗啊，只要你抓到很多，還是能賺錢的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"對，你跟著依娜姆大姐，肯定能賺錢的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你死了，你爸爸媽媽該多傷心啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們？他們早就被我氣死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你們怎麼總是死啊死的，我說了我是要去死了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們繼續唱歌吧！你想學我們這裡的歌嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"妹妹種地——♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼——吸——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們幾個沒完沒了了話怎麼這麼多啊上次遇到的那個小丫頭嘴都比你們清閒點我怎麼沒買膠布來把你們嘴黏上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！這人突然在說哪裡的話？也不是薩爾貢語吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"完了，她眼睛怎麼突然有一個變色了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃！嗚噗！呃呃呃！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！謝天謝地，她醒了，你們快帶她走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"嘔、呃、嗚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！謝失敗了，又睡過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，你們那裡總該有醫生吧，別在我這裡耗時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趕緊走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好，謝謝你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"（但是她看起來還是怪怪的，要不我們準備個麻袋，不行的話就把她敲暈帶走！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放屁！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊，醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天可真累啊......趁他們幾個還沒來，趕緊走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"東西全了，走了走了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到眼前看就感覺更加難以接近了，哇，待會兒會遇到什麼呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"當耳朵被瀑布的轟鳴聲填滿，周圍就彷彿變得異常安靜。石棉逆著快要將她吞噬的水流，拽了拽這根頂端沒入洶湧水花的繩索。\n每次都是如此，從地面往一個未知的高處攀登，或者是往下方深入。\n自己只知道去處有著讓人震驚無言的壯麗風景，但不知道一路上將會遇到什麼樣的困難。\n有可能是滑倒、跌落，有可能是遇到猛獸、風雪，更有可能是意想不到的災難和艱險——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，這裡的水流太大了，根本站不住！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（樹枝，那裡有根樹枝！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......很好，卡在這裡了，很結實，順著它爬過去應該能避開水流......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好滑——！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她曾經在湍急的激流中失去平衡，在彷彿永無伸頭呼吸時機的漩渦裡憋氣到幾近昏厥；\n她曾經在黑夜裡不慎從半山腰踩空，最後簡單固定著骨折的小臂，忍著痛站在山頂，就為了看日出的那一刹；\n她曾經在冰川上滑倒直直滾落，比想像中更鋒利的冰碴劃破了她所有裸露的皮膚，但在重新爬起來的時候，當夕陽透過彤雲灑向冰面——\n那些美麗的橙紫色光芒映在光滑的冰層上，它們伴著冰原上特有的，略帶甘味的風湧進她的眼睛，她的鼻腔。\n那一瞬間，石棉無暇去關心自己那些正在流血的傷口，她發自內心地覺得，不管付出了什麼，都真的值得。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳咳咳......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼、呼、差點沒喘上氣......咳、這水也太猛了......還好這裡有個縫讓我卡住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒死！就差一點了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_aerialview"},{"type":"narration","text":"每一次當她再度爬起來，她都會這麼想。\n真*雷姆必拓粗口*的值得。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_falls_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"半個小時後"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"累死我了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我看了一圈，沒有毒蟲，她不會死，可以放心了！欸，這裡還有這種藤？哇，好多！這裡長了好多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"這上面是個好地方啊，這麼難找的藤在這裡有這麼多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，你雖然凶了點，但是也很厲害嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，說什麼呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"不許你誇她，是我先看上她的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，那個，卡納也跟我說了，你們外鄉人可能不喜歡打架，那天是我不對，不應該先打你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"但你的尾巴真的很帥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......囉囉嗦嗦的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都閉嘴看風景！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幾個氣喘吁吁的阿達克利斯人身上沾滿了泥水，一兩個頭上還黏上了不知從哪裡蹭到的野草。\n野草搭在他們的腦袋上，被從山谷裡吹來的帶著水氣的大風揚起，打著旋飛上了天空，越飛越高，直到再也看不見。\n他們看到了之前從未見過的風光——自己的家鄉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"哇——你看那邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"喔、哇——這！"},{"type":"narration","text":"壯美的，震撼人心的，一股難明的情感湧上這幾個人的心頭，他們學著這個看著風景出神的外鄉人，對著山谷發出了長長的歡呼聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚喂——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真美啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"真好啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"我想唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"我們把她圍起來吧！手拉手，來，唱起來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"瀑布豐水，好抓鱗~♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"尾巴甩甩，鱗上鉤~♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"爬上瀑布，真是美~♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"真是美啊，真是美~♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。行吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是美~♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別轉了頭暈！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"直爽的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"歡聲笑語，響破天~♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"響破天~♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快樂的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我們走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"再見！再見！我的朋友！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，再見，再見！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"累死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這群人也太能鬧了，我寧願爬十個瀑布。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這回的遊記寫什麼好呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個月後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，石棉托我給你們送來的雜誌，每人都有一本！上面寫了之前來這裡探險的遊記哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"遊記......就是在一個新地方的心情和見識的記錄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我路上看了看，她對風景的評判可真是刁鑽啊，明明從瀑布上下來的時候高興得很呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......這上面是雷姆必拓語，我給你們翻譯一下吧，我看那邊宣傳的可都是什麼“石棉新增版塊《當地人見聞》”，你們被寫進去了哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們被寫進書裡了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳！第一句是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“很吵鬧，但也有趣。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
